   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Los números",
    "@en": "The numbers"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Del 1 al 10 hay que saberlos de memoria. El resto se construye sumando y multiplicando: **じゅういち** (10 + 1 = 11), **にじゅう** (2 × 10 = 20), **にじゅうご** (25). **ひゃく** es 100.",
     "@en": "From 1 to 10, you have to know them by heart. The rest is built by adding and multiplying: **じゅういち** (10 + 1 = 11), **にじゅう** (2 × 10 = 20), **にじゅうご** (25). **ひゃく** is 100."
    },
    {
     "@es": "El 4, el 7 y el 9 tienen dos lecturas. Las más usadas al contar son **よん**, **なな** y **きゅう**.",
     "@en": "The 4, the 7 and the 9 have two readings. The most used when counting are **よん**, **なな** and **きゅう**."
    }
   ]
  },
